0000:                   ********************************************************************
0000:                   * Dir - Show directory
0000:                   *
0000:                   * $Id$
0000:                   *
0000:                   * This dir initially started from the dir command that came with
0000:                   * the OS-9 Level Two package, then incorporated Glenside's Y2K
0000:                   * fix.
0000:                   *
0000:                   * Edt/Rev  YYYY/MM/DD  Modified by
0000:                   * Comment
0000:                   * ------------------------------------------------------------------
0000:                   *  10      1999/05/11  Boisy G. Pitre
0000:                   * Incorporated Glenside Y2K fixes.
0000:                   *
0000:                   *  11      2003/01/14  Boisy G. Pitre
0000:                   * Made option handling more flexible, now they must be preceeded
0000:                   * by a dash.
0000:                   *
0000:                   *  11      2003/01/14  Boisy G. Pitre
0000:                   * Made option handling more flexible, now they must be preceeded
0000:                   * by a dash.
0000:                   *
0000:                   *  11r1    2005/04/19  Boisy G. Pitre
0000:                   * Made column width code more robust.
0000:                   *
0000:                   *  12      2005/11/22  Boisy G. Pitre
0000:                   * -e option now uses SS.FDInf for portability to other file managers
